:: awakening__sleep_again [awakening]
<!-- harness:meta
location: cartography_shop
-->

You tell yourself it is a dream. You close your eyes against the lamplight and the smell of ozone and you will yourself back to sleep.

But the ink does not care if you are awake.

When you next open your eyes the map has changed again. The river now has a name written in a hand that is almost yours: *The Serpentine*. And outside, through the window, you can hear water where no water has ever been.

You hear it. And then you hear the knocking.

<<set $has_discovered_power to false>>
<<set $guild_trust to $guild_trust - 1>>

You cannot ignore this anymore.

